apter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"亮至南，上表曰：“永昌郡吏吕凯、府丞王伉等，执忠绝域〖26〗，十有余年；雍闿、高定逼其东北，而凯等守义不与交通。臣不意永昌风俗敦直乃尔","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":43,"end":110},{"id":"huangli-q-f6c9e4b9e1a303b85350","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-d5b6b0e65380c6f0e3c3","layer":"original","quote":"而王伉亦封亭侯，为永昌太守","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":94,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":25,"end":38},{"id":"huangli-q2-6254044d8d3612c9cdf7","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-1f594d574238f76d3965","layer":"original","quote":"凯威恩内著，为郡中所信，故能全其节。及丞相亮南征讨阉，既发在道，而闿已为高定部曲所杀。亮至南，上表曰：“永昌郡吏吕凯、府丞王伉等，执忠绝域〖26〗，十有余年；雍闿、高定逼其东北，而凯等守义不与交通。臣不意永昌风俗敦直乃尔！”","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":112}],"profiles":{"huangli-p0025":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"shu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
